  "operation source: sim/refresh-op (#110) phase definitions (precharge-on 2 ns, gap 2 ns, latch delay 1 ns, guard 2 ns, measurement settle 2 ns, 100 ps edges) imported from gen_refresh_op.py; SENSE = 10 ns, WB = 10 ns",
